    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What the...?! THIS is Greta's plan for the shoot?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Originium storm's right in our faces! What are we, some sort of suicide squad?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... no way... This has to be the killer's doing, right? Didn't you hear the explosion earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone blew up the plate's cockpit... There's no way we can slow the plate down or change directions now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now we're only barely in contact with the storm, but once we hit its core...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not gonna find even a single brick from this plate... *sob*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, enough!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "So who on Terra was it? Their revenge wasn't enough for them, so now they're gonna take out the rest of us too?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The... murderer is Moira of the prop team...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice over the Wireless"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Who's talking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "r",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#4$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I said! The killer responsible for the three murders is Moira!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira...? You're kidding me... That unremarkable Zalak?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Stone caught her red-handed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Lucian weren't there, she would've become the next victim!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So where's the little rat now? I'll go find her myself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what's the point of confronting a psycho killer when you can't even save yourself?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She owes us an explanation! What if she gets innocents killed?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I haven't thought of that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already switched the wireless comms to broadcast mode to ensure I survive this. I'm sure everyone outside the plate has heard the truth by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "The killer's trapped like a rat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to live, I have to... Once I get back to central Wrankwood, all the bombshells I've collected these past few days will be enough to buy me a villa in Siesta\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "e"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 4,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "e",
        "fadetime": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockfall",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shit! The plate's tilting towards the Originium storm again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, the landboats! We can use them to escape!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...They're gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1845_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I went over to the emergency escape cabin earlier, and they were already wrecked by the storm... every last one of them...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1847_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way out for us now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "text": "...If I'm going to die anyway, I might as well take the chance and jump off the plate... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scared Staff"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1844_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut that shit out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just move! Anywhere's safer than the film set! Let's go hide underground in the engine layer!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Camera Assistant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
