    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There truly are so many things to learn from the set design of a horror film... Thank you, Tippi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to get back and start making the visualizations for most of the visual effects first, then we'll finalize the details after Director Quay is done with the script.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like I promised, I'm gonna design you a finale that'll leave Lady Dupont in the cinema history!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, I'm looking forward to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Wait, how long have we talking about this? Did Molly ever find a way to escape\u2014)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "e"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 4,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "e",
        "fadetime": 4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-What now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, there's a voice from the comms...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Catastrophe... *bzzt*... control cabin... destroyed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice over the Wireless"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why's the signal so bad? It sounded like Abner's assistant. What kinda trouble is he getting into now\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The control cabin... has been destroyed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice over the Wireless"
    },
    {
        "text": "The plate... is rushing towards the Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice over the Wireless"
    },
    {
        "text": "...killer... is Moira...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice over the Wireless"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Tippi grips the wireless walkie-talkie and turns the volume knob as high as she can, but it stays silent."
    },
    {
        "text": "She must have misheard, she thinks."
    },
    {
        "text": "But if so, why is Miss Rutherford looking at her with such a sullen expression?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... There's no way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tippi... I can't imagine anyone would joke about that in these circumstances.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... When would she have even had the opportunity?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The nights when Shelly, Michael, and Marion died, she was watching movies with me the whole time, there wasn't\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was there really no opportunity?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tippi doubts her own mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "Was Molly really right next to her the whole time during their movie nights?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "We always watched multiple movies back to back, so sometimes she'd leave when I was switching out the tape...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sometimes she'd say Miss Stone was looking for her, sometimes it was to pick up something she forgot on the film set...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure you know how she's like, ma'am. She's still new to being the prop master and under, like, a ton of pressure, but she's super committed to her work...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Darling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, that only explains how she <i>could've</i> done it! It doesn't prove that she did...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A motive! Why would she kill all those people she had nothing to do with? Why don't I know anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Darling, maybe you didn't know your friend as well as you thought you did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "62_i12",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.4,
        "yScale": 1.4,
        "y": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 0,
        "xTo": -100,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0.8,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just focus on the movie... so stop looking away from the screen!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, there's just been so much going on with the film crew lately, I'm... I'm a little nervous...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I'm here for you, girl!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter who I am, one thing's for sure: I'm your best friend on this crew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g12_dressingroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "amount": 0,
        "keep": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Or maybe... maybe she never even thought of me as a friend...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she was just... using me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Liberi girl's head sinks."
    },
    {
        "text": "She speaks no more."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Melanie hugs the little Liberi in front of her."
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl who was consoling her just a few hours ago is now crying on her shoulder."
    },
    {
        "text": "Melanie pats her back. She asks no questions, nor does she say anything about the price of growing up. She only hugs her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just leave this place first, Tippi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "text": "The convoluted structure here will only put us in danger if the plate gets too close to the Catastrophe core.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "text": "We would be safer underground, though that too may be futile if the plate doesn't change direction...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Underground...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over Melanie's shoulders, Tippi spots some of the material they salvaged from the horror film earlier."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Underground'\u2014The word circles around her brain."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, I got it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? You've recovered your pep already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I figured out how to change the plate's trajectory!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was once a crew that snuck into another Wrankwood plate to film secretly\u2014to save on rental costs\u2014and they ended up with a super cool scary movie...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I re-watched it recently.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that plate and the one we're standing on both came from the same batch made by Wrankwood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "So basically, the specs should be pretty much the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If my hunch is right... there should be another control cabin at the bottom of the engine layer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1830_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What are our odds of making it there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Melanie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest... no idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But never tell me the odds. I gotta try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no point mulling over something I can't answer on my own. Only when we're out of this crisis...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will I be able to get the truth from her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
