    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Gentle singing\u266a)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Cheerful whistling\u266a)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is where you were, Lucian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_bat_rglk1normal1_intro",
        "key": "$m_bat_rglk1normal1_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was my sister's favorite song. On breaks between shooting she'd often look to the sky and hum the tune.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you'd already woken up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks to you. You showed me the truth I was blind to... and how cruel they truly were.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what are you doing now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 4,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 3,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_erthshkng",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "e"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "e",
        "fadetime": 6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A rumbling comes from beneath their feet. The Wrankwood plate rushes towards the Catastrophe as the crew panics. No one would think to enter the prop room now, when they should be escaping."
    },
    {
        "text": "But it is at this very moment that the prop master gets to work."
    },
    {
        "text": "She goes around the room, fiddling with one mannequin after another, dressing them in clothes, correcting their postures... Her earnest focus is fully on them."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only just remembered how I recognized Laura.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you will allow me a guess... you met someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, a very gentle Feline.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cavewaterdrop",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "ca"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 1,
        "channel": "ca",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "cg_floatingleaves",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xFrom": 60,
        "xTo": -60,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The weather was terrible that day. I was sitting on a bench for a long time, and there was water on my face\u2014probably rain, but maybe tears...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "The accident was caused by the negligence of the person in charge, but in the end I was the one who had to pay compensation and was kicked off the crew.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't know anyone in Wrankwood, so I was no stranger to being treated like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I ran away from home, you know. After my parents died, there was nowhere else to go. So the only thing left for me was...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then that person sat next to me. We didn't talk the entire time. He only gently waited for me to calm down...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when he left, I realized a cassette tape was sitting on my knee.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "ca",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "62_g6_proproom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That man brought Laura into my life, at a time when there was only darkness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "She became my sister. She protected me, encouraged me, and helped me pull myself together...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Laura was already long dead by then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her background, experiences, and even appearance all resembled yours. The man gave you motivation when you were at your lowest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "As well as anger, confusion, and a deep-rooted thirst for vengeance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No doubt, that was no better than before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that grief I saw flash through your eyes...? Or... pity? No, that's not it either...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "More like... understanding, sympathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did something similar happen to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's an expert at grafting non-existent joy and anger onto your life, much like how an unscrupulous director adds extra elements as he pleases to a story he deems dull...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I suppose you would call it 'ad-libbing' in the film industry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "He pulls you from one pit of despair while guiding you into another, thus inciting the so-called beauty of drama.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...He's an old acquaintance, my teacher, the source of all my suffering, and a phantom that should be long dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Finding you, finding him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the very reason I came here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#14$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira, I'm sorry for denying all that you have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#10$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. It's not like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_openftstpwalk",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira finishes arranging her last mannequin, and returns to the center of the prop room."
    },
    {
        "text": "She does a curtsy in Lucian's direction, and lightly taps her fingertips."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian then realizes something has changed, and looks over to see that every mannequin has come 'alive'."
    },
