    {
        "text": "I don't think you've denied me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "In my worst hour, Laura appeared by my side, and has accompanied me for a long time now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's my sister, as I am hers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't regret avenging her. I don't regret shouldering all these sins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will also be the last person in this land to remember her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I cry, I laugh, I rage, I doubt, I hate, I grieve, I yearn...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "And thus I have them, these intense feelings I would never have had otherwise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
