    {
        "text": "The mannequins begin to move."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian recognizes who they were modeled after... the deceased Dalton, Shelly, Michael, Marion, and also Moira herself."
    },
    {
        "text": "Moira stretches out her hand, and holds her mannequins' hands one by one as they move past her."
    },
    {
        "text": "No music except the trembling ground accompanies their movements, but the tiny Zalak prop master seems to have become the most passionate dancer on the land, as she embraces her myriad..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Strange, yet elegant."
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "channel": "pu",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I should be thanking you, Lucian. You helped me realize it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "When there was nothing left of 'Moira' anymore...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "I felt as if I became a mirror, and that I could become\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wake up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Satisfaction born from despair is nothing but poison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never been more awake in my entire life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "Would you also like to become my dance partner?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Just like them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "As Moira finishes speaking, her dance partners throw themselves at Lucian\u2014"
    },
